  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2718c5863d8c65a4aa712d078446307f, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - I'm back from asking some of the forest folk,
  - but phew, I'm exhausted from all that running around!
  - The local Jay told me that they had seen something. I could lead you to them,
    but...
  - ...first, let me take a nap. In the meantime, if you like, you can bring me some
    of those shaggy ink caps!
